name: Operator brief editing and immutable finite-plan association
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/investigation_brief.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 30 PLAN A STUDY | study
expect: Goal and priorities
keys: Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 30 WRITE INVESTIGATION BRIEF | empty-editor
paste-file: @ART/brief-text.txt
require-live-snap: 20 package license declaration | pasted-goal
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW BRIEF REVISION | review-first
expect: Previous accepted text
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Shown revision: 1 | saved-first
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/investigation_brief.py @TMP_TARGET @ART first
ask: Does review save exact multiline operator text and select its revision without changing evidence, prompts, work or allowance?
keys: e
paste-file: @ART/brief-addition.txt
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Unsaved text differs | retained-unsaved
keys: a
expect: Unsaved text differs
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW BRIEF REVISION | review-second
resize: 160x48
live-snap: brief-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: brief-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: brief-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: brief-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: brief-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: brief-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: brief-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: brief-page-3-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: brief-page-4-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: brief-page-5-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: brief-page-6-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: brief-page-7-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: brief-page-8-40x12
expect: Second revision
ask: Are saved and proposed text distinguishable at every size, with readable paging and save/back controls?
resize: 120x36
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Shown revision: 2 | saved-second
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/investigation_brief.py @TMP_TARGET @ART revised
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Goal and priorities | brief-selected
expect: revision 2
keys: Escape
submit: setup
require-live-snap: 25 SETUP · READY THE MAP RUN | setup-unaccepted
expect-not: Map ✓
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | explicit-quit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 30 PLAN A STUDY | restarted-study
keys: Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Shown revision: 2 | restarted-brief
expect: Second revision
keys: Escape
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/exact-brief-command.txt
keys: Enter
wait: 0.5
submit: logs
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 revision 1 | frozen-first-read
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/investigation_brief.py @TMP_TARGET @ART revised
ask: Does restart retain both immutable revisions and the original plan's approved brief, with zero jobs, provider calls or finding decisions?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
